Dialogue: 0,00:00:00.10,00:00:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Psychology says: When a person goes silent, they have already made their decision.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:05.94,00:00:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule 1: Never react to disrespect.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:09.71,00:00:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Your silence is louder than anger.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:12.61,00:00:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule 2: Keep your plans invisible.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:16.06,00:00:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,People cannot destroy what they do not know.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:19.32,00:00:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule 3: Watch their eyes, not their lips.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:23.52,00:00:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The eyes never lie.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:25.76,00:00:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Subscribe to ArisVexx.
